  "title": "TVB: deprecate tvb_get_bits() in favor of tvb_get_bits32()",
  "description": "With the changes to the tvb_get_bits*() functions throughout the years\n(43bb2aea, b688f915, 9b36fc78, 075bd9f8, 7b821100) the function\ntvb_get_bits() became equivalent to tvb_get_bits32(). In order to\nreduce ambiguity and reduce the API deprecate the implicit function\ntvb_get_bits() for the explicit function tvb_get_bits32().",
